      "title": "Calisher & Terry Half-cocking rifle",
      "audio": "audio/en/AB002.mp3",
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Single barrel percussion cap breechloader with bolt action lock. This weapon is loaded at the lock with a paperbound round wherein the gunpowder and lead bullet were encased. It is ignited by means of a conventional muzzleloader percussion cap. The breachloader is one of the first used by the British army."
        },
